# Domain + routes sync

New domain/sub-domain, `*.container.ts`, `*.routes.ts`, or `src/routes.ts` wiring? Run
**[be-domain-generator](../skills/be-domain-generator/SKILL.md)**. A new domain runs the
**new-domain** chain and a route change the **route-change** chain, each in its order — their rows
of [`agent-os/docs/skill-triggers.md`](../docs/skill-triggers.md), generated from `agent-os/skills/chains.json` (this rule keeps no copy of the steps).
